    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ambra\nLEGCARE 20\nÆGIS\nMicrobe Shield\n'Antibacterial Microbe Shield'\nfor health \u0026 freshness\nhighly durable 20 denier pantyhose for medium leg support.\ncontrol brief\n100% cotton gusset\n20 denier\ncomposition: 81% nylon\n16% elastane 3% cotton\nreinforced toe\n40\nplease check the chart below for your correct size.\nif your height or weight are borderline you may wish to choose the larger size.\n45\n50\n55\n60\nWEIGHT KGS\n65\n70\n75\n80\n85\nMEDIUM\n9C\n411-\ns1-\nHEIGHT CMS\n888888\nHEIGHT FT/INS\n88\n99\nTALL\nEXTRA TALL\n110\n121\n132\n143\nWEIGHT LBS\n154\n165\n176\nwe recommend gentle machine wash using a washbag.\nor hand wash with mild fabric soap in warm water.\ndo not bleach. do not tumble dry. do not iron.\nLEG CARE 20 P/H\nBLACK\nX-TALL\nambra\n992090\nQLC014\n9315731 097634\nDistributed exclusively by Ambra Corporation Pty Ltd\nABN 46 078 821 904\nMade in Chind\n187",
